{"product_id":"when-time-runs-out","title":"When Time Runs Out","description":"\u003cp\u003eA young man is shooting people from a rooftop in downtown Helsinki. An unsuspecting mother is confronted with a horrifying scenario she's powerless to stop. A sister can only watch events unfold from afar. Over the course of a day, one family fractures and each member must examine everything that brought them to this moment. But this crisis goes beyond their small lives; Aslak is not the only boy on a rooftop with a gun today. He is part of an international group set on stopping environmental disaster by killing as many of those they deem responsible as they can. Can a desperate mother reconcile her complicated feelings towards her son and reach him in time to stop a catastrophe?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Elina Hirvonen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781786580276\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45743088107673,"sku":"16RA-2-9781786580276","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d17d2528c37_When_Time_Runs_Out_Elina_Hirvonen.jpg?v=1758708578","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/when-time-runs-out","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}